[quote="AlexxKay"]

&quot;When Omnitron is destroyed, remove Omnitron&#39;s Villain Character card from play. The Heroes cannot win until there are no Devices in play.&quot;

Clearly, the final sentence is meant to remain in force, even though the card it is written on has been removed from play.&nbsp;

[/quote]

But only the <em>character</em> card is removed from play - not the <em>gameplay</em> card where the sentence is written. There is no problem if you are using the normal sized cards for the villain, the original format. Only the oversized card causes problem, as it combines the two cards in one.
